<v Host>It means a period of time.

00:02:42.692 --> 00:02:50.180
<v Slow>23日は「勤労感謝の日」で、休みの日です。

00:02:50.979 --> 00:02:55.563
<v Host>The twenty-third is Labor Thanksgiving Day, a national holiday.

00:02:56.163 --> 00:03:03.219
